  "_template_doc": {
    "title": "Task 1 — Full 27-Layer PDN Design Template: Core Compute (VDDUC* on LDB U7..U5) & Chiplet/Hub (VDDCH* on LDC U2..U1)",
    "how_to_use": [
      "1. Edit any parameter below (target RefDes/nets, L01 SURFACE VIA ratio & strap mode, per-layer L01..L27 polarity/shape_mode/split_gap_um, real eDTC catalog, Core PTH density, 9F->5F & 9B->5B stitch pitch, or BASE curved recess & 180-deg LSC rules).",
      "2. Compile & validate all 27 layers: python -m agent04_pdn_architect.templates.pdn_27layer_template_runner --config agent04_pdn_architect/templates/task1_vdduc_vddch_27layer_template.json",
      "3. Inspect generated SVGs + Layer Summary JSON in agent04_pdn_architect/reports/template_builds/task1_vdduc_vddch/, then run the generated *_run_apd_headless.bat (or add --build-mcm) to produce a new .mcm database."
    ]
  },
